OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start, followed by a
OL,6,Fbright and largely sunny day. However
OL,7,Fthe odd shower remains possible for
OL,8,Fthe east Kent coast where it will be
OL,9,Frather breezy. Feeling chilly.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cold but dry night with
OL,12,Fextensive clear spells allowing a
OL,13,Ffrost to form, particularly in rural
OL,14,Flocations. Coastal spots could still
OL,15,Fsee the odd shower through the night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FAnother cold and frosty start,
OL,18,Fwith plenty of sunshine around.
OL,19,FRemaining dry overnight with extensive
OL,20,Fclear spells, allowing a frost to form.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
